%% Event Flow — 14:02 → 18:18 那個午後（對齊 scripts/e2e/e2e.md 與 scripts/ocpp-sim）
%% 識別碼一律來自 docs/curriculum.md §1.6；事件名來自 §1.7 / §1.8 / §1.9。
%% 實線 = 命令 / 呼叫；虛線 = 事件（經 Outbox relay，至少一次）。模擬器以 HTTP POST 送 OCPP frame。
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Driver as 車主 ABC-1234
  participant LPR as 既有停車場系統（Parking stub）
  participant CP as CP-A12 (scripts/ocpp-sim)
  participant ACL as HTTP /ocpp/CP-A12 → OcppAcl
  participant CH as ChargingService + ChargingSession(CP-A12-2)
  participant OB as OutboxRelay
  participant BUS as InMemoryEventBus
  participant BI as BillingDraftConsumer
  participant AO as FaultProcessManager + WorkOrder
  participant DP as DispatchService stub
  actor Tech as 阿豪 TECH-HAO

  rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
    note over Driver,BI: 正常午後：停車 + 充電（R1、R3、R4、R6）
    Driver->>LPR: 14:02 開到閘門
    note right of LPR: VehicleEntered → P-441 Active（parking.vehicle_entered.v1，stub）

    Driver->>CP: 14:04 插槍 CP-A12-2、刷 TAG-MONTHLY-77
    CP->>ACL: Authorize(idTag=TAG-MONTHLY-77)
    ACL-->>CP: idTagInfo.status=Accepted（本機白名單，不呼叫總部）
    CP->>ACL: StartTransaction(connectorId=2, idTag, meterStart=0)
    ACL->>CH: startCharging(sessionId=S-991, connectorId=CP-A12-2, idTag, meterStartWh=0, at=14:04)
    note over CH: authorized=true（AuthorizationService）<br/>ChargingSession.idle(CP-A12-2).start(...) → ChargingStarted<br/>commit：save + outbox.add（R8，同一交易）
    ACL-->>CP: transactionId=991（ACL 對應 991 ↔ S-991）
    OB-->>BUS: charging.session.started.v1 (sessionId=S-991, connectorId=CP-A12-2, idTag, startedAt=14:04)
    BUS-->>BI: started.v1
    note right of BI: 建立草稿 INV-778（一個 sessionId 一張）

    CP->>ACL: 14:05 第二張卡 TAG-VISITOR-01 StartTransaction(connectorId=2)
    ACL->>CH: startCharging(sessionId=S-992, idTag=TAG-VISITOR-01, ...)
    note over CH: R1：status 已是 Charging → ChargingStartRejected(ConnectorOccupied)<br/>S-991 不變；拒絕事件不對外
    ACL-->>CP: idTagInfo.status=Blocked

    CP->>ACL: 14:13 MeterValues(4000 Wh)
    ACL->>CH: reportMeterValue(S-991, 4000)
    note over CH: R3 4000 ≥ 0 → EnergyMetered（不對外）
    CP->>ACL: 14:22 MeterValues(8000 Wh)
    ACL->>CH: reportMeterValue(S-991, 8000)

    Driver->>CP: 14:31 App 停止
    CP->>ACL: MeterValues(12400) + StopTransaction(transactionId=991, meterStop=12400, reason=Local)
    ACL->>CH: reportMeterValue(S-991, 12400) 再 stopCharging(S-991, stopReason=Local, at=14:31)
    note over CH: R4 Charging → Completed<br/>energyWh = 12400 − 0 = 12400
    OB-->>BUS: charging.session.completed.v1 (sessionId=S-991, energyWh=12400, startedAt, endedAt, stopReason=Local)
    BUS-->>BI: completed.v1
    note right of BI: sessionId 去重；12.4 kWh × 8 元 = 99.2 元（草稿）

    Driver->>LPR: 14:33 出閘門（總部離線）
    note right of LPR: R6 阿忠 manualRelease → ParkingManuallyReleased + VehicleExited(releaseMode=Manual)<br/>parking.session.closed.v1 進 Outbox，連線恢復再送
  end

  rect rgb(255, 235, 238)
    note over CP,Tech: 故障支線：申告 → 開單 → 派工 → 重複申告 → 重送 → 關單（R5、冪等）
    CP->>ACL: 18:10:00 StatusNotification(connectorId=2, status=Faulted, errorCode=GroundFailure)
    ACL->>CH: reportFault(chargerId=CP-A12, connectorId=CP-A12-2, faultCode=GroundFailure, at=18:10:00)
    note over CH: ChargerFaulted(stillEnergized=false)；CP-A12-2 狀態 Faulted，停售
    OB-->>BUS: charging.charger.faulted.v1 (eventId=evt-A, chargerId=CP-A12, faultCode=GroundFailure, occurredAt=18:10:00)
    BUS-->>AO: faulted.v1 (evt-A)
    note over AO: processedEventIds 無 evt-A<br/>findOpenByFault(CP-A12, GroundFailure) → 無<br/>WorkOrder.open → WO-2208（SLA 自 occurredAt=18:10:00 起算）
    AO-->>BUS: ops.work_order.opened.v1 (workOrderId=WO-2208, chargerId=CP-A12, faultCode=GroundFailure, openedAt=18:10:00)
    AO->>DP: requestTechnician(WO-2208, CP-A12)
    DP-->>AO: TECH-HAO（stub，固定指派）
    note over AO: WO-2208.assign(TECH-HAO) → TechnicianAssigned（AssetOps 內部，不對外）
    BUS-->>CH: opened.v1（場站看板副本）

    CP->>ACL: 18:10:08 StatusNotification(Faulted, GroundFailure) 再報一次
    ACL->>CH: reportFault(...)
    OB-->>BUS: charging.charger.faulted.v1 (eventId=evt-B, occurredAt=18:10:08)
    BUS-->>AO: faulted.v1 (evt-B)
    note over AO: R5：WO-2208 開放中 → appendDuplicateReport(18:10:08)<br/>duplicateReportCount=1；不發第二個 opened

    BUS-->>AO: 18:12 broker 重送 faulted.v1 (evt-A，同一 eventId)
    note over AO: processedEventIds 已有 evt-A → 忽略（傳輸層冪等）<br/>duplicateReportCount 仍 = 1

    Tech->>AO: 18:18 回報修復驗證 → closeWorkOrder(WO-2208, outcome=Repaired)
    AO-->>BUS: ops.work_order.closed.v1 (workOrderId=WO-2208, chargerId=CP-A12, closedAt=18:18, outcome=Repaired)
    BUS-->>CH: closed.v1 → CP-A12 恢復可售
    note over Driver,Tech: E2E 斷言：S-991 Completed 12400 Wh；草稿 1 張 INV-778；工單 1 張 WO-2208 Closed、duplicateReportCount=1；<br/>opened ×1、closed ×1、started ×1、completed ×1；所有整合事件 correlationId 相同
  end
